<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 6.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 6.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it lowered the cut-off to 98.47 rupees from 98.59 at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield rose to 6.23 percent from 5.74 percent at the last auction.</p>
